spans.s:
प्रति-√ नन्द् P. -नन्दति, to greet cheerfully, salute (also in return), bid welcome or farewell, address kindly, favour, befriend, AV. &c. &c.;
to receive joyfully or thankfully, to accept willingly (with न, to decline, refuse, reject), Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -नन्दयति, to gladden, delight, gratify, MBh.; Kām.

प्रति-नि-√ धा P. -दधाति, to put in the place of another, substitute, ŚrS.; Śaṃk.;
to order, command, MBh.;
to slight, disregard, MW.

. pl. fut. -वर्त्स्यथ, MBh.), to turn back or round, return, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to turn away from (abl.), escape, run away, take flight, MBh.;
to cease, be allayed or abated, BhP. :
Caus. -वर्तयति, to cause to go back, turn back, avert, R.; BhP.
